          "711600301": {
            "id": "711600301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "If you make a lantern like this and release it... Will the wish really come true...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600302"
            ]
          },
          "711600302": {
            "id": "711600302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Layla?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600303"
            ]
          },
          "711600303": {
            "id": "711600303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Oh! You're in Liyue too? Happy Lantern Rite...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600317"
            ]
          },
          "711600317": {
            "id": "711600317",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Wow... your lantern's so far up there! Huh, I wonder how high it could go...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600318"
            ]
          },
          "711600318": {
            "id": "711600318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Oh, right, there's a formula for that! I just have to plug in the numbers. Now where's my scratch paper...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600304"
            ]
          },
          "711600304": {
            "id": "711600304",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here for the festival, Layla?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600306"
            ]
          },
          "711600306": {
            "id": "711600306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Yeah, my advisor sent me. She said participating in folk festivals might help spark some inspiration for my research...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600307"
            ]
          },
          "711600307": {
            "id": "711600307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "But... I work on Star Charts. I'm still not sure what that has to do with holidays like this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600308"
            ]
          },
          "711600308": {
            "id": "711600308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "But she had already bought me a ticket and escorted me onto the boat before I even had a chance to ask...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600309"
            ]
          },
          "711600309": {
            "id": "711600309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "As soon as I got off the boat, a lady stopped and offered me a free Xiao Lantern frame. She said releasing one would bring good luck for the entire year.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600310"
            ]
          },
          "711600310": {
            "id": "711600310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "I'm... not sure I need a whole year of luck. But, a little bit when it's time to submit my thesis wouldn't hurt...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600311"
            ]
          },
          "711600311": {
            "id": "711600311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "So, I followed her instructions and made one...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600313"
            ]
          },
          "711600313": {
            "id": "711600313",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Luck will certainly find you, Layla.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600314"
            ]
          },
          "711600314": {
            "id": "711600314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Layla",
            "text": "Thanks. I should release the lantern now, right? Oh! I need to write my wish on it first...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "711600315"
            ]
          },
          "711600315": {
            "id": "711600315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You and Layla release a Xiao Lantern together..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
